<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 6.5 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 6.5 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 6.5 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on June 2.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 9.0 trillion lire on April 28, the minimum accepted rate stood at 7.09 percent and the average rate at 7.11 percent.</p>
